= RDF test data: Turtle (.ttl)

Turtle serialization samples. Mix of: real-world DBpedia entity data, an
EasyRdf FOAF fixture, several W3C standard vocabularies/ontologies, W3C Turtle
test-suite syntax tests, and one synthetic project fixture.

ddot.it/this ..format.. format:turtle
ddot.it/this ..content.. Turtle documents: collected real-world data, W3C vocabularies and syntax tests, plus one synthetic fixture

# DBpedia entity data, collected
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Berlin in Turtle
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..depicts.. the German capital Berlin (DBpedia resource)
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..tests.. real-world data, language-tagged and typed literals, many prefixes
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-berlin.ttl ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 and GNU FDL

dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Karlsruhe in Turtle
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..depicts.. the German city Karlsruhe (DBpedia resource)
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..tests.. real-world multilingual data, language tags, typed literals
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.ttl ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 and GNU FDL

# EasyRdf, collected
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..kind.. collected
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..content.. FOAF example from the EasyRdf test fixtures in Turtle
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..tests.. FOAF vocabulary, person/profile triples, prefixed names
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..source url.. https://github.com/easyrdf/easyrdf
easyrdf-foaf.ttl ..license.. BSD-3-Clause

# Synthetic project fixture
labels-and-comments.ttl ..kind.. synthetic
labels-and-comments.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
labels-and-comments.ttl ..content.. a small ontology snippet (RDF Concepts vocabulary / rdf:HTML datatype) with multilingual rdfs:label and rdfs:comment
labels-and-comments.ttl ..tests.. rdfs:label and rdfs:comment, language tags ("HTML"@en / "LMTH"@fr), owl:Ontology and rdfs:Datatype declarations
labels-and-comments.ttl ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
labels-and-comments.ttl ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

# W3C standard vocabularies / ontologies, collected
w3c-dcat.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-dcat.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
w3c-dcat.ttl ..content.. the W3C DCAT (Data Catalog) vocabulary/ontology
w3c-dcat.ttl ..tests.. real ontology: classes, properties, multilingual labels
w3c-dcat.ttl ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/ns/dcat
w3c-dcat.ttl ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

w3c-org.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-org.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
w3c-org.ttl ..content.. the W3C Core Organization (ORG) ontology
w3c-org.ttl ..tests.. real ontology with multilingual labels and rich class/property definitions
w3c-org.ttl ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/ns/org
w3c-org.ttl ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

w3c-prov.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-prov.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
w3c-prov.ttl ..content.. the W3C PROV-O provenance ontology
w3c-prov.ttl ..tests.. large real ontology, many classes/properties
w3c-prov.ttl ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/ns/prov
w3c-prov.ttl ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

w3c-rdf-syntax-ns.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-rdf-syntax-ns.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
