w3c-rdf-syntax-ns.ttl ..tests.. core RDF vocabulary terms
w3c-rdf-syntax-ns.ttl ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns
w3c-rdf-syntax-ns.ttl ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

w3c-shacl.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-shacl.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
w3c-shacl.ttl ..content.. the W3C SHACL (Shapes Constraint Language) vocabulary/ontology
w3c-shacl.ttl ..tests.. real ontology, shapes/constraints vocabulary
w3c-shacl.ttl ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/ns/shacl
w3c-shacl.ttl ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

# W3C ORG ontology excerpt with de-anonymized blank nodes, collected
w3c-org-deanon.ttl ..kind.. collected
w3c-org-deanon.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
w3c-org-deanon.ttl ..content.. excerpt of the W3C ORG ontology in Turtle with blank nodes named/de-anonymized
